=== Basic Usage ===
{| class="wikitable"
! Code
! Description
! Example
! Output
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{UserLinks}}</nowiki></code>
| Shows all links
| Profile • Blog • Contributions
| {{UserLinks}}
|-
