| Shows just Blog link
| Blog
| {{UserLinks|type=blog}}
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{UserLinks|type=plain}}</nowiki></code>
| Shows just username
| (username)
| {{UserLinks|type=plain}}
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{UserLinks|type=profile}}</nowiki></code>
| Shows just profile link
| (linked username)
