=== Parameters ===
; type
: Controls which links to display (optional)
: Default: <code>all</code>
{| class="wikitable"
! Value
! Description
|-
| <code>all</code>
| All links in a navigation bar
|-
| <code>plain</code>
| Just username
|-
| <code>profile</code>
| Profile link
|-
| <code>blog</code>
| Blog link
|-
| <code>blog-full</code>
| Blog link with username
|-
| <code>contribs</code>
| Contributions link
|-
| <code>contribs-full</code>
| Contributions link with username
|-
| <code>full</code>
| All links with parsed wikitext
|}
=== Technical Details ===
* Works in conjunction with [[MediaWiki:Common.js]] to automatically:
** Display the current user's name
** Check if user pages exist
** Hide links to non-existent pages (e.g., if user has no blog)
** Parse and insert proper wikilinks
* Uses specific CSS classes that are targeted by JavaScript:
** <code>username-plain</code>
** <code>username-wikilink</code>
** <code>username-blog</code>
** <code>username-blog-full</code>
** <code>username-contribs</code>
** <code>username-contribs-full</code>
** <code>username-profile-links</code>
** <code>username-profile-links-parsed</code>
</noinclude>